  (C) the CReal-level per-cosine-term second-difference bound
        |cosFull(θ+h) − cosFull(θ) − (−sinFull(θ))·h| ≤ ε·|h|  for 0<|h|≤δ(ε),
  assembled from (B-signed) + `cos_small_angle`/`sin_small_angle` +
